sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Monitoring System / Load Balancer
    participant E as Inbound HTTP Endpoint
    participant R as Router
    participant H as Healthcheck Handler
    M ->> E: POST /events (target = healthcheck)
    Note over E,R: Process Inbound Event
    E ->> R: handle(Event)
    Note over R: Route Inbound Event
    R ->> H: handle(Event, dispatcher)
    H -->> R: Event (payload = true)
    R -->> E: Event
    E -->> M: HTTP response
    Note over R,H: Code: HealthcheckHandler (io.eventbob.dropwizard / io.eventbob.spring)
    Note over R,H: Tests: HealthcheckHandlerTest
